appealablePenalties.title                     = Appealable penalties
appealablePenalties.heading.zeroPenalties     = There are no penalties to appeal
appealablePenalties.heading.onePenalty        = There is one penalty you can appeal
appealablePenalties.heading.multiplePenalties = There are {0} penalties you can appeal
appealablePenalties.zeroPenalties.link.prefix = You can check the progress of any appeal received by HMRC in
appealablePenalties.zeroPenalties.link.text   = Notices and statements
appealablePenalties.nonZeroPenalties.p1       = To appeal a penalty, select the Penalty ID. You can only appeal one penalty at a time.
