beforeYouStart.title = Before you start
beforeYouStart.heading = Before you start
beforeYouStart.p1 = To appeal a penalty, you must tell us:
beforeYouStart.list.bullet1.text = the reason that led to the penalty, HMRC calls this a
beforeYouStart.list.bullet1.linkText = reasonable excuse (opens in new tab)
beforeYouStart.list.bullet2 = when the reasonable excuse ended
beforeYouStart.list.bullet3 = what happened in your own words
beforeYouStart.warning = If HMRC decide we need extra information or evidence after reviewing your appeal, we will contact you.
beforeYouStart.button = Start the appeal

excuseEndDateKnown.title = Do you know when your reasonable excuse ended?
excuseEndDateKnown.heading = Do you know when your reasonable excuse ended?
excuseEndDateKnown.hint = This is the earliest date you could have acted to avoid the penalty
excuseEndDateKnown.checkYourAnswersLabel = Do you know when your reasonable excuse ended?
excuseEndDateKnown.error.required = Select yes if you know when your reasonable excuse ended
excuseEndDateKnown.change.hidden = if you know when your reasonable excuse ended

reasonableExcuseEndDate.title             = When did your reasonable excuse end?
reasonableExcuseEndDate.heading           = When did your reasonable excuse end?
reasonableExcuseEndDate.group1.hint       = This is the earliest date you could have acted to avoid the penalty. For example, 27 3 2024.
reasonableExcuseEndDate.group3.hint       = For example, 27 3 2024
